{"html":"<h1>CORS</h1>\n<p>This guide shows how to configure CORS in a Vix API.</p>\n<p>CORS is needed when a frontend running on one origin calls an API running on another origin.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>Frontend: http://localhost:5173\nAPI:      http://localhost:8080</code></pre><h2>What is CORS?</h2>\n<p>An origin is composed of scheme + host + port.\nThe browser uses CORS to decide whether frontend JavaScript is allowed to call an API on another origin.</p>\n<h2>Setup</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> cors-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> cors-api</span></span></code></pre><pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/middleware.hpp></span></span></code></pre><h2>Simple CORS setup</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">cors_dev</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"http://0.0.0.0:5173\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span></code></pre><h2>Custom CORS options</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::CorsOptions options;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allowed_origins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"https://app.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allow_any_origin </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allow_credentials </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allow_methods </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"GET\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"PUT\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"PATCH\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"DELETE\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"OPTIONS\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allow_headers </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"Content-Type\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"X-Requested-With\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Origin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.expose_headers </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"X-Request-Id\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">adapt_ctx</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">cors</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(options))));</span></span></code></pre><h2>Prefix-specific CORS</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">use_on_prefix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    app,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"/api\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">cors_dev</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">({</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span></code></pre><h2>Credentials</h2>\n<p>Enable when your frontend must send cookies or auth headers:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allow_credentials </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre><blockquote>\n<p>When credentials are enabled, do not use wildcard origins in production.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Development vs production</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">// Development</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">middleware</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">cors_dev</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">({</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">// Production (explicit origins only)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allowed_origins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"https://app.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre><h2>Test</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/profile</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"Origin: http://localhost:5173\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># Preflight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> OPTIONS</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/messages</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"Origin: http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"Access-Control-Request-Method: POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization\"</span></span></code></pre><h2>CORS headers explained</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Header</th>\n<th>Purpose</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code></td>\n<td>Defines which origin is allowed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Methods</code></td>\n<td>Defines which HTTP methods are allowed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Headers</code></td>\n<td>Defines which request headers are allowed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials</code></td>\n<td>Defines whether credentials are allowed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Access-Control-Expose-Headers</code></td>\n<td>Defines which response headers JS can read.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Common mistakes</h2>\n<h3>Allowing the API origin instead of frontend origin</h3>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">// Wrong</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allowed_origins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:8080\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">// Correct — allow the FRONTEND origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">options.allowed_origins </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:5173\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre><h3>Using wildcard with credentials</h3>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *\nAccess-Control-Allow-Credentials: true   // NEVER combine these</code></pre><h3>Applying CORS after route logic</h3>\n<p>Install middleware before route registration.</p>\n<h2>Production checklist</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Only real frontend origins are allowed</li>\n<li>No wildcard origin with credentials</li>\n<li>HTTPS is enabled</li>\n<li><code>Authorization</code> header is allowed if using tokens</li>\n<li>Credentials enabled only if using cookies/sessions</li>\n<li>OPTIONS requests are handled</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What to use next</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/guides/rate-limiting\">Rate limiting guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/guides/authentication\">Authentication guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/guides/sessions\">Sessions guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}
